--- a/changelog/7144.bugfix.rst
+++ b/changelog/7144.bugfix.rst
@@ -0,0 +1 @@
+Fixed ``unittest.TestCase.addCleanup`` functions not being called when the test failed: resources registered via ``addCleanup`` now run like in plain ``unittest``.
--- a/changelog/7145.bugfix.rst
+++ b/changelog/7145.bugfix.rst
@@ -0,0 +1 @@
+Fixed ``unittest.TestCase`` tests erroring with ``RuntimeWarning: TestResult has no addDuration method`` on Python 3.12+.
--- a/src/_pytest/unittest.py
+++ b/src/_pytest/unittest.py
@@ -1,4 +1,5 @@
